WEBVTT

00:02:07.190 --> 00:02:11.350
Saint Seiya

00:03:26.660 --> 00:03:29.500
The Three of the Lament

00:03:35.480 --> 00:03:38.030
It disappeared. Seiya's body.

00:03:38.330 --> 00:03:42.510
It's like he's been swallowed by
the light of a numerous stars.

00:03:54.670 --> 00:03:55.610
Mu.

00:03:56.870 --> 00:04:02.870
Your Starlight Extinction
is as awesome as ever.

00:04:04.080 --> 00:04:08.690
But you can't fool my eyes.

00:04:11.080 --> 00:04:13.560
Where did you send Pegasus?

00:04:19.370 --> 00:04:21.620
Where?

00:04:22.690 --> 00:04:29.090
The only destination of the
Starlight Extinction is hell.

00:04:31.230 --> 00:04:35.580
Fine. It's only one Bronze Saint.

00:04:35.660 --> 00:04:39.710
It doesn't matter if he's dead or alive.

00:04:40.540 --> 00:04:45.070
Deathmask, Aphrodite. Get Athena's head.

00:04:45.450 --> 00:04:48.640
Mu can't go against me.

00:04:49.080 --> 00:04:49.970
Yes, sir.

00:04:51.310 --> 00:04:52.970
Right away.

00:05:11.160 --> 00:05:14.330
Mu, do you still not understand?

00:05:14.990 --> 00:05:20.450
To go against those two
is to rebel against me.

00:05:21.160 --> 00:05:25.630
Guarding the Aries house is my duty.

00:05:26.320 --> 00:05:28.440
I also told you so.

00:05:29.050 --> 00:05:34.610
If this is rebellion against you,
I will pay for it with death.

00:05:35.240 --> 00:05:36.190
However!

00:05:37.700 --> 00:05:40.020
Deathmask and Aphrodite.

00:05:40.170 --> 00:05:42.860
I'll never forgive you two.

00:05:43.210 --> 00:05:45.710
I'll send you to hell with my own hands!

00:05:46.870 --> 00:05:48.670
This is the first time Mu

00:05:49.370 --> 00:05:57.670
has bared his fangs tucked behind
his gentle lamb's fleece.

00:05:57.790 --> 00:06:00.580
As Athena's Saints,

00:06:00.580 --> 00:06:07.680
to choose life siding with Hades
and then go after Athena's life?

00:06:10.100 --> 00:06:16.300
I can't let your filthy souls
step into the Aries house.

00:06:16.760 --> 00:06:19.810
I will take care of you myself.

00:06:20.020 --> 00:06:21.600
Take this, Mu!

00:06:21.600 --> 00:06:23.520
Layers of Death!

00:06:24.320 --> 00:06:26.190
I'll pierce your heart.

00:06:27.150 --> 00:06:29.380
Bloody Rose!

00:06:33.800 --> 00:06:36.540
The Underworld, the place of no return.

00:06:36.810 --> 00:06:37.740
Run away!

00:06:37.870 --> 00:06:40.880
Starlight Extinction!

00:06:42.260 --> 00:06:43.370
What?

00:06:59.940 --> 00:07:00.770
Old Master.

00:07:01.860 --> 00:07:03.490
Shunrei.

00:07:03.840 --> 00:07:07.310
Where are you headed?

00:07:08.810 --> 00:07:10.580
Well...

00:07:10.970 --> 00:07:14.900
No, it's better for you not to know.

00:07:15.520 --> 00:07:17.420
Then, when will you return?

00:07:17.560 --> 00:07:20.100
I don't know.

00:07:20.440 --> 00:07:25.420
Perhaps I may never return.

00:07:25.610 --> 00:07:29.080
No, what has happened?

00:07:29.600 --> 00:07:31.430
Listen, Shunrei.

00:07:32.020 --> 00:07:38.650
Even if I don't return, you have Shiryu.

00:07:41.470 --> 00:07:48.650
Don't let go of gentle Shiryu whom you adore.

00:07:53.090 --> 00:07:58.580
Shiryu. Seiya. Hyoga. Shun. Ikki.

00:07:59.030 --> 00:08:03.960
I'm sorry to have made you fight for so long.

00:08:04.410 --> 00:08:12.830
I hope you can live as ordinary
young men from now on.

00:08:12.830 --> 00:08:16.980
And that is also Athena's wish.

00:08:25.720 --> 00:08:29.650
Listen, you two be happy together.

00:08:36.110 --> 00:08:36.990
Old Master!

00:08:37.100 --> 00:08:38.260
Old Master!

00:08:56.430 --> 00:08:58.890
Deathmask, Aphrodite,

00:08:58.890 --> 00:09:04.800
your bodies have been
returned to the Underworld.

00:09:05.020 --> 00:09:08.000
Right. You two really are.

00:09:09.010 --> 00:09:13.490
Mu, you are the fool.

00:09:14.110 --> 00:09:18.770
The battle isn't over because
you eliminated those two.

00:09:19.070 --> 00:09:22.450
You must excuse me if I will not back down.

00:09:23.340 --> 00:09:27.430
Until I take care of all 108 Specters.

00:09:27.430 --> 00:09:30.690
It's not about the 108 Specters.

00:09:32.010 --> 00:09:37.850
Deathmask and Aphrodite aren't the
only ones to come for Athena's head.

00:09:38.060 --> 00:09:39.510
What?

00:09:46.300 --> 00:09:50.270
There are still several
Specters around that person.

00:09:50.830 --> 00:09:55.360
No this Cosmo are ones
I've confronted before.

00:10:04.050 --> 00:10:04.830
Could it be?

00:10:20.710 --> 00:10:22.060
You guys too?

00:10:22.650 --> 00:10:28.680
You guys have been lured
by Hades to kill Athena?

00:10:33.800 --> 00:10:34.950
Light a fire.

00:10:35.210 --> 00:10:36.450
Shina.

00:10:36.530 --> 00:10:39.830
If we do that, the corpses of
the Saints who rest here...

00:10:40.210 --> 00:10:43.620
Exactly. We'll burn them all at once.

00:10:45.530 --> 00:10:51.080
It's no use surrounding the Sanctuary.

00:10:52.420 --> 00:10:53.080
The enemy.

00:10:53.960 --> 00:10:59.050
The enemy sent by Hades will
appear from within the Sanctuary.

00:10:59.800 --> 00:11:02.440
Shina! Ichi, Nachi!

00:11:06.800 --> 00:11:10.850
We're too late. We can't
do anything at this point.

00:11:12.270 --> 00:11:17.610
The strongest of the Gold Saints
have come back as enemies.

00:11:19.590 --> 00:11:24.240
The Sanctuary will be destroyed from within.

00:11:28.760 --> 00:11:29.830
You are?

00:11:30.300 --> 00:11:32.220
Where are Old Master and Shiryu?

00:11:33.090 --> 00:11:34.840
Why do I have to answer you?

00:11:35.170 --> 00:11:36.620
If you don't speak.

00:11:36.710 --> 00:11:37.790
It'll do you no good.

00:11:43.130 --> 00:11:47.100
Will you speak or does it
have to be forced out of you?

00:11:47.100 --> 00:11:48.020
No!

00:11:53.130 --> 00:11:54.440
What are you doing?

00:11:55.030 --> 00:11:55.820
You mustn't come!

00:12:06.080 --> 00:12:09.670
Let go of Shunrei. Your business is with me.

00:12:11.820 --> 00:12:12.710
Shiryu.

00:12:15.960 --> 00:12:16.920
That voice.

00:12:17.090 --> 00:12:19.670
If you can't remember, I'll remind you.

00:12:23.500 --> 00:12:25.240
Perseus Argol.

00:12:25.430 --> 00:12:27.100
Auriga Capella.

00:12:27.300 --> 00:12:28.720
Cerberus Dante.

00:12:29.250 --> 00:12:32.140
That voice belongs to a Silver Saint.

00:12:32.810 --> 00:12:36.300
But what is up with your evil Cosmo?

00:12:36.920 --> 00:12:38.730
What happened?

00:12:39.000 --> 00:12:40.800
What happened you ask?

00:12:40.800 --> 00:12:44.120
We've been resurrected by Hades.

00:12:45.030 --> 00:12:45.860
Hades?

00:12:45.960 --> 00:12:46.890
And...

00:12:47.730 --> 00:12:48.610
Shiryu!

00:12:55.340 --> 00:12:59.010
Shiryu, we've come for yours
and Old Master's life.

00:13:00.250 --> 00:13:04.920
What? So the reason Old Master's presence
vanished is because of Hades too?

00:13:05.450 --> 00:13:09.930
Rain or wind, he didn't
budge under the waterfall.

00:13:10.170 --> 00:13:13.200
Old Master's Cosmo is completely gone.

00:13:13.980 --> 00:13:16.940
I don't know where Old
Master is, however Shiryu.

00:13:17.230 --> 00:13:19.800
Your life ends here!

00:13:24.520 --> 00:13:25.860
Stop!

00:13:26.090 --> 00:13:27.160
Die, Shiryu!

00:13:31.840 --> 00:13:32.730
Heh.

00:13:39.090 --> 00:13:41.550
You can still move?

00:13:46.880 --> 00:13:51.180
Move aside, I will follow Old Master.

00:13:53.290 --> 00:13:55.270
What can you do in that shape?

00:13:55.430 --> 00:13:59.490
Even if I cannot see, I
will follow Old Master!

00:14:01.060 --> 00:14:02.070
Fool!

00:14:03.470 --> 00:14:05.850
Have you forgotten since losing your body?

00:14:05.850 --> 00:14:08.630
The Cosmo burns in the heart!

00:14:11.790 --> 00:14:14.330
Rising Dragon!

00:14:40.500 --> 00:14:41.850
Even you guys.

00:14:48.030 --> 00:14:49.780
Capricorn Shura.

00:15:02.690 --> 00:15:04.620
Aquarius Camus.

00:15:23.210 --> 00:15:26.280
And Gemini Saga.

00:15:30.450 --> 00:15:35.740
Even you guys have pledged to
Hades to take Athena's life?

00:15:36.050 --> 00:15:39.040
Precisely. Move out of the way, Mu.

00:15:40.360 --> 00:15:41.320
Shura.

00:15:41.790 --> 00:15:44.260
If you don't, I will simply eliminate you.

00:15:44.780 --> 00:15:45.870
Excalibur!

00:15:52.990 --> 00:15:57.750
Avoiding by teleportation? You won't
get away with a few hairs next time.

00:15:58.560 --> 00:16:01.560
Shura, don't make Mu shed unnecessary blood.

00:16:02.240 --> 00:16:03.370
I'll do it.

00:16:04.710 --> 00:16:05.810
Camus.

00:16:08.550 --> 00:16:09.990
This chill.

00:16:10.580 --> 00:16:12.530
Diamond Dust!

00:16:24.840 --> 00:16:29.640
I can't let you soldiers of Hades pass.

00:16:30.840 --> 00:16:33.970
Will you still fight, with that wound?

00:16:38.330 --> 00:16:41.530
A Gold Saint's duty.

00:16:41.790 --> 00:16:43.730
Cannot be broken.

00:16:43.830 --> 00:16:49.120
True. A man like Mu cannot be moved by force.

00:16:49.680 --> 00:16:52.990
We will at least show mercy by burying him.

00:16:53.780 --> 00:16:54.770
Saga.

00:16:59.470 --> 00:17:04.080
What has happened to make Old
Master leave Five Ancient Peaks?

00:17:19.360 --> 00:17:21.480
I'm sorry, Shunrei.

00:17:31.840 --> 00:17:36.820
Saga, have you all sold your souls?

00:17:37.580 --> 00:17:39.130
Not exactly.

00:17:40.630 --> 00:17:44.910
We saw what needed to be done
and the road we needed to take.

00:17:45.040 --> 00:17:49.290
Is going against Athena what
a Gold Saint should do?

00:17:50.320 --> 00:17:51.440
That's right.

00:17:52.430 --> 00:17:54.340
I misjudged you.

00:17:54.340 --> 00:17:55.090
Saga.

00:18:02.220 --> 00:18:08.230
Mu, is that all you got? I overestimated you.

00:18:08.230 --> 00:18:09.060
What?

00:18:09.060 --> 00:18:12.410
You should know your weakness!

00:18:18.190 --> 00:18:18.820
Too slow!

00:18:22.600 --> 00:18:24.290
Do you think you've avoided the attacks?

00:18:29.260 --> 00:18:34.180
Do you understand, Mu.
You're efforts are futile.

00:18:34.910 --> 00:18:36.880
I don't understand. Why?

00:18:44.050 --> 00:18:45.130
Perhaps...

00:18:49.550 --> 00:18:50.450
Saga.

00:18:56.000 --> 00:18:57.290
He's crying.

00:18:59.230 --> 00:19:02.630
Saga, his heart is crying.

00:19:04.250 --> 00:19:08.230
Not just Saga, Camus and Shura too.

00:19:08.610 --> 00:19:13.410
Their souls are shedding tears of blood.

00:19:17.280 --> 00:19:18.460
Mu.

00:19:18.870 --> 00:19:21.350
I see. I understand.

00:19:22.520 --> 00:19:23.260
Be prepared.

00:19:26.760 --> 00:19:27.890
My body.

00:19:29.520 --> 00:19:34.830
Saga, enough. I've restrained Mu.

00:19:35.780 --> 00:19:41.720
I will finish off Mu. You
guys get Athena's head.

00:19:45.620 --> 00:19:49.470
We have twelve hours.

00:19:49.920 --> 00:19:53.420
Unless we get Athena's head by then.

00:19:53.840 --> 00:19:55.630
You know the rest.

00:19:55.830 --> 00:19:56.690
Yes.

00:19:58.880 --> 00:20:00.010
Wait.

00:20:12.770 --> 00:20:14.170
They're gone.

00:20:18.640 --> 00:20:19.530
Yes.

00:20:19.900 --> 00:20:21.520
I can't cry.

00:20:24.440 --> 00:20:27.150
Until both of them return safely.

00:20:36.630 --> 00:20:43.170
Mu, this is for your acts of rebellion
against me. Are you ready?

00:20:45.500 --> 00:20:48.570
And yet I still care for you.

00:20:48.970 --> 00:20:53.140
I will make sure you don't suffer.

00:20:55.240 --> 00:20:58.330
Farewell, Mu!

00:21:02.330 --> 00:21:03.030
What?

00:21:09.110 --> 00:21:11.160
Who lit the fires?

00:21:13.300 --> 00:21:14.620
I did.

00:21:19.360 --> 00:21:20.290
Old Master.

00:21:29.380 --> 00:21:32.990
It's been a long time, my friend.

00:21:34.330 --> 00:21:35.500
Dohko.

00:21:36.080 --> 00:21:39.220
It's been 243 years.

00:21:40.020 --> 00:21:43.110
But to meet under these circumstances.

00:21:43.180 --> 00:21:48.190
I didn't think we'd meet again.

00:21:50.070 --> 00:21:54.790
How about you show your face, my friend.

00:21:56.840 --> 00:22:01.000
And the Pope who lost his
life during Saga's rebellion.

00:22:02.530 --> 00:22:05.320
Your name also used to be a Gold Saint.

00:22:06.500 --> 00:22:08.770
Aries Shion!

00:22:21.800 --> 00:22:24.460
My master, Aries Shion.

00:22:24.770 --> 00:22:27.890
But what is that appearance?

00:22:30.760 --> 00:22:35.340
We're both 261 years old.

00:22:35.750 --> 00:22:43.590
But you haven't changed since
the holy war 243 years ago.

00:22:44.270 --> 00:22:49.920
Are you surprised, Dohko?
This is the power of Hades.

00:22:49.980 --> 00:22:51.010
What?

00:22:51.300 --> 00:22:58.170
For pledging loyalty to Hades,
I've been given youth.

00:22:58.600 --> 00:23:05.150
And the ideal body of an 18-year-old.

00:23:05.950 --> 00:23:08.510
Compared to that, Dohko,

00:23:09.550 --> 00:23:10.870
you have aged.

00:23:11.860 --> 00:23:13.580
It's an illusion.

00:23:13.990 --> 00:23:15.020
What?

00:23:15.430 --> 00:23:20.380
Your life and youth is an illusion.

00:23:21.150 --> 00:23:24.580
Why do you think I lit the
fires on the clock tower?

00:23:26.200 --> 00:23:31.050
Your lives will go out with those fires.

00:23:31.610 --> 00:23:37.340
You yourself should know this best, Shion.

00:23:39.680 --> 00:23:40.600
Mu.

00:23:40.600 --> 00:23:41.650
Yes.

00:23:41.650 --> 00:23:44.560
Go after Saga and the others.

00:23:44.660 --> 00:23:51.290
Join Aioria and the others and keep
the Specters away from Athena.

00:23:52.640 --> 00:23:56.160
Twelve hours until the clock tower goes dark.

00:23:56.410 --> 00:24:00.790
Protect Athena until then.

00:24:04.070 --> 00:24:06.010
You should be able to move.

00:24:07.910 --> 00:24:08.840
I can.

00:24:09.430 --> 00:24:13.550
I will take care of things here. Go, Mu.

00:24:14.050 --> 00:24:15.510
Yes. I'll be going.

00:24:17.400 --> 00:24:18.470
Wait, Mu!

00:24:18.610 --> 00:24:19.730
Don't move!

00:24:20.960 --> 00:24:24.680
Shion, I'll be your opponent.

00:24:25.160 --> 00:24:30.320
It's been 243 years, we'll take it slow.

00:24:31.210 --> 00:24:36.790
If we fight, we may fall into
a thousand day war again.

00:24:37.180 --> 00:24:39.990
Dohko, is that what you seek?

00:24:40.470 --> 00:24:42.240
Bring it on.

00:26:12.460 --> 00:26:15.610
The 108 demons. The Specters make their move.

00:26:15.880 --> 00:26:19.220
Do their evil powers surpass
even those of the Gold Saints?

00:26:19.630 --> 00:26:21.540
Mu, we will fight too!

00:26:21.840 --> 00:26:25.530
Shun. Hyoga. Even if the Silver
Saints should try to stop us,

00:26:25.530 --> 00:26:28.850
we will kick out those whose
Cosmo have been tainted by evil.

00:26:29.260 --> 00:26:32.060
Saint Seiya, "The Shadow
of the One Who Struggles."

00:26:32.310 --> 00:26:33.550
"Expiation of the Immortal."

00:26:33.860 --> 00:26:36.640
Do you sense the Cosmo?
